    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1920ead64f1de1cb7640d26b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心情嗨翻天♪然～后～呢～？\\n全力爆走一波啰☆FOOO～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c6fa26e6294a085770485d42250c619609710e9ece588ee887bd29536d75ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "975"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6555837c8f677f034d94add2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "升天飞马MIX超多嗨爆珍奶！\\n说到会嗨的果然就是这个了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "510c7d6726c45f0a8cd3040053ecb0e91ed3ab76eb9c6f207ff58961448e5040",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "976"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c5968ed4ac9413b69e6fc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有满满的自信啦～！\\n到时候就在优胜者区域和我约一波吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "678975124e956e214bcc98f624fce890ef2de4664b9ea907b6d74b161e14b447",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "977"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3a5f0b90ff358713a8c84c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之先把训练员室变成夜店～\\n再用DJ训练员爆诞☆嗨翻来庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc0676a46da59607c496fd9273e9c4b2e78c70769c430b446773e7b47d6973b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "978"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd95e69151aed308fc7047f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有满满的自信啦～！\\n到时候就在优胜者区域和我约一波吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "678975124e956e214bcc98f624fce890ef2de4664b9ea907b6d74b161e14b447",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "979"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be007540bbbb7c52b593df11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是的。而且还是在刚起床的时候。\\n我当时真的不知道该做出什么反应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713f8f9bbec3fe2b05f9d230aa48e8c4b6d8daa66f60d569e54841c10de17f55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b114d5a8d0cc1bf6685028",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之先把训练员室变成夜店～\\n再用DJ训练员爆诞☆嗨翻来庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc0676a46da59607c496fd9273e9c4b2e78c70769c430b446773e7b47d6973b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "980"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197921b8e93f241fc744211e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好得不得了！\\n毕竟我的涡轮引擎可是在轰隆隆地响着呢！",
